<section id="Pt0.A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.A </span>Proof of Theorem 1</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we prove Theorem <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 3.1 ‣ 3.1 Flow Divergence as Discrepancy Surrogate ‣ 3 Method ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> in Sec. <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Flow Divergence as Discrepancy Surrogate ‣ 3 Method ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> of the main paper.
We begin by recalling the flow matching setup and assumptions in Sec. <a href="#Pt0.A1.SS1" title="0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.A.1</span></a>.
We then establish the auxiliary results needed for the proof in Sec. <a href="#Pt0.A1.SS2" title="0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.A.2</span></a>.
Finally, we present the proof of Theorem <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 3.1 ‣ 3.1 Flow Divergence as Discrepancy Surrogate ‣ 3 Method ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> in Sec. <a href="#Pt0.A1.SS3" title="0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.A.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.1 </span>Setup (Definitions and assumptions)</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the setup in Sec. <a href="#S2" title="2 Preliminaries ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, let <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}\sim p_{0}:=\mathcal{N}(0,I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}\sim p_{0}:=\mathcal{N}(0,I)</annotation></semantics></math> and let <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{1}\sim p_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{1}\sim p_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Let <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha,\beta:[0,1]\to\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha,\beta:[0,1]\to\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math> be differentiable schedules, and define the interpolant</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}:=\alpha_{t}x_{1}+\beta_{t}x_{0}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}:=\alpha_{t}x_{1}+\beta_{t}x_{0},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is monotonically increasing in <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is monotonically decreasing in <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\alpha_{0},\beta_{0})=(0,1),(\alpha_{1},\beta_{1})=(1,0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\alpha_{0},\beta_{0})=(0,1),(\alpha_{1},\beta_{1})=(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>,
so that <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> evolves from noise to data.</p>
</div>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Sample-wise velocity <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</h4>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Differentiating <a href="#Pt0.A1.E12" title="In 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> with respect to <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> (holding <math id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{0},x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{0},x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> fixed) gives</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}:=\frac{\mathrm{d}x_{t}}{\mathrm{d}t}=\dot{\alpha}_{t}\,x_{1}+\dot{\beta}_{t}\,x_{0}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}:=\frac{\mathrm{d}x_{t}}{\mathrm{d}t}=\dot{\alpha}_{t}\,x_{1}+\dot{\beta}_{t}\,x_{0}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Consequently, the interpolant induces the following conditional probability path:</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=\mathcal{N}\big(\alpha_{t}x_{1},\ \beta_{t}^{2}I\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=\mathcal{N}\big(\alpha_{t}x_{1},\ \beta_{t}^{2}I\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Optimal marginal velocity under MSE.</h4>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS1.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Under the mean squared error (MSE) objective, the optimal marginal velocity field is given by</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x_{t})\;=\;\mathbb{E}\big[v_{t}\mid x_{t}\big]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x_{t})\;=\;\mathbb{E}\big[v_{t}\mid x_{t}\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.2 </span>Gaussian identities for the interpolant</h3>

<div id="Thmlemma1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lemma 1</span></span><span id="Thmlemma1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> </span>(Conditional probability path score <math id="Thmlemma1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>)</h6>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>. Then the conditional probability path is given by</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=\mathcal{N}\big(\alpha_{t}x_{1},\ \beta_{t}^{2}I\big)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=\mathcal{N}\big(\alpha_{t}x_{1},\ \beta_{t}^{2}I\big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and its score satisfies</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\;=\;-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}^{2}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\;=\;-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">proof.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">From the interpolant</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}=\alpha_{t}x_{1}+\beta_{t}x_{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}=\alpha_{t}x_{1}+\beta_{t}x_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">and the assumption <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)</annotation></semantics></math>, it follows that, conditioning on <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is Gaussian with mean <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}x_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and covariance <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}^{2}I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}^{2}I</annotation></semantics></math>. This proves <a href="#Pt0.A1.E14" title="In Sample-wise velocity 𝑣_𝑡. ‣ 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>.
<br class="ltx_break">Next, by <a href="#Pt0.A1.E14" title="In Sample-wise velocity 𝑣_𝑡. ‣ 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>, the log-density takes the form</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=-\frac{1}{2\beta_{t}^{2}}\|x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}\|^{2}+C," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=-\frac{1}{2\beta_{t}^{2}}\|x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}\|^{2}+C,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> is constant with respect to <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Differentiating with respect to <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> yields</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}^{2}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})=-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}^{2}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">which proves <a href="#Pt0.A1.E17" title="In Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lemma 2</span></span><span id="Thmlemma2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> </span>(Marginal score <math id="Thmlemma2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> identity)</h6>
<div id="Thmlemma2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and assume <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the marginal density of <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t})=\int p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t})=\int p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under mild regularity conditions allowing differentiation and integration to be interchanged,</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})=\mathbb{E}\!\left[\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.222em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})=\mathbb{E}\!\left[\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Consequently,</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})=-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]}{\beta_{t}^{2}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})=-\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]}{\beta_{t}^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">proof.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Differentiating</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t})=\int p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t})=\int p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">with respect to <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> under the integral sign gives</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{t})=\int\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{t})=\int\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})\,p_{1}(x_{1})\,dx_{1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Dividing both sides by <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> yields <a href="#Pt0.A1.E18" title="In Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>. Substituting <a href="#Pt0.A1.E17" title="In Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a> from Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> into <a href="#Pt0.A1.E18" title="In Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> then gives
<a href="#Pt0.A1.E19" title="In Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lemma 3</span></span><span id="Thmlemma3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> </span>(Posterior score <math id="Thmlemma3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> identity)</h6>
<div id="Thmlemma3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and assume <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. By Bayes’ rule,</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})-\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{1})-\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Combining Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> yields</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}}\Big(x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]\Big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}}\Big(x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]\Big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">proof.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{1}(x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{1}(x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> does not depend on <math id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, Bayes’ rule gives <a href="#Pt0.A1.E20" title="In Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>.
Substitute the conditional score <a href="#Pt0.A1.E17" title="In Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a> from Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>
and the marginal score <a href="#Pt0.A1.E19" title="In Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a> from Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> into <a href="#Pt0.A1.E20" title="In Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>
to obtain <a href="#Pt0.A1.E21" title="In Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.3 </span>Main Proof</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Theorem 0.A.1</span></span></h6>
<div id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any <math id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the optimal CFM residual satisfies</span></p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}^{*}_{\text{CFM}}(x_{t},t)=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\right\|^{2}\;\middle|\;x_{t}\right]=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}d\Big)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">CFM</mtext><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}^{*}_{\text{CFM}}(x_{t},t)=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\right\|^{2}\;\middle|\;x_{t}\right]=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}d\Big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Pt0.A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> is the dimensionality of the data.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<section id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">proof.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fix <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> (as in Lemmas
<a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>–<a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>) and define</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}:=\dot{\alpha}_{t}-\alpha_{t}\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}:=\dot{\alpha}_{t}-\alpha_{t}\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We also note that <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> since <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> are strictly monotonic and nonzero.</p>
</div>
<div id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We first express the posterior score <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}-u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}-u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
From <a href="#Pt0.A1.E12" title="In 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> with <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}=\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}=\frac{x_{t}-\alpha_{t}x_{1}}{\beta_{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Substituting into <a href="#Pt0.A1.E13" title="In Sample-wise velocity 𝑣_𝑡. ‣ 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> gives the affine form</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="v_{t}=\underbrace{\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}}_{=:a_{t}}\,x_{t}+\underbrace{\Big(\dot{\alpha}_{t}-\alpha_{t}\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}\Big)}_{=:b_{t}}\,x_{1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder accentunder="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}=\underbrace{\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}}_{=:a_{t}}\,x_{t}+\underbrace{\Big(\dot{\alpha}_{t}-\alpha_{t}\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}\Big)}_{=:b_{t}}\,x_{1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.3" class="ltx_p">Taking conditional expectation given <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and using <a href="#Pt0.A1.E15" title="In Optimal marginal velocity under MSE. ‣ 0.A.1 Setup (Definitions and assumptions) ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x_{t})=\mathbb{E}[v_{t}\mid x_{t}]=a_{t}x_{t}+b_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x_{t})=\mathbb{E}[v_{t}\mid x_{t}]=a_{t}x_{t}+b_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.4" class="ltx_p">Subtracting <a href="#Pt0.A1.E25" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a> from <a href="#Pt0.A1.E24" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a> yields</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})=b_{t}\Big(x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]\Big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})=b_{t}\Big(x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]\Big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.5" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]=\frac{1}{b_{t}}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{1}-\mathbb{E}[x_{1}\mid x_{t}]=\frac{1}{b_{t}}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.6" class="ltx_p">On the other hand, by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (Conditional probability path score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡∣𝑥_1)) ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2 (Marginal score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, Bayes’ rule yields
Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>; in particular, <a href="#Pt0.A1.E21" title="In Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a> holds. Combining
<a href="#Pt0.A1.E27" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a> with <a href="#Pt0.A1.E21" title="In Lemma 3 (Posterior score ∇_𝑥_𝑡⁢log⁢𝑝_𝑡⁢(𝑥_1∣𝑥_𝑡) identity) ‣ proof. ‣ 0.A.2 Gaussian identities for the interpolant ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a> gives</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}\,b_{t}}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})=\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}\,b_{t}}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.7" class="ltx_p">We differentiate
<math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x_{t})=\int v_{t}\,p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\,dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x_{t})=\int v_{t}\,p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\,dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>,
we obtain</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Pt0.A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int(J_{x_{t}}v_{t})\,p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\,dx_{1}+\int v_{t}\,\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})^{\top}dx_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int(J_{x_{t}}v_{t})\,p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\,dx_{1}+\int v_{t}\,\nabla_{x_{t}}p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})^{\top}dx_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Pt0.A1.E29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[J_{x_{t}}v_{t}\mid x_{t}]+\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}\big(\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\big)^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[J_{x_{t}}v_{t}\mid x_{t}]+\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}\big(\nabla_{x_{t}}\log p_{t}(x_{1}\mid x_{t})\big)^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.8" class="ltx_p">From <a href="#Pt0.A1.E24" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>, <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}=a_{t}x_{t}+b_{t}x_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}=a_{t}x_{t}+b_{t}x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, hence</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{x_{t}}v_{t}=a_{t}I=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{x_{t}}v_{t}=a_{t}I=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.9" class="ltx_p">Substituting <a href="#Pt0.A1.E30" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">30</span></a> and <a href="#Pt0.A1.E28" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">28</span></a> into <a href="#Pt0.A1.E29" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">29</span></a> yields</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I+\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big)^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I+\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}\big(v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})\big)^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.10" class="ltx_p">Define the residual <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{t}:=v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{t}:=v_{t}-u_{t}(x_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>. Since <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[r_{t}\mid x_{t}]=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[r_{t}\mid x_{t}]=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{t}=u_{t}+r_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{t}=u_{t}+r_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, so</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Pt0.A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\!\left[v_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\!\left[(u_{t}+r_{t})r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}\right]=u_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}]+\mathbb{E}[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\!\left[(u_{t}+r_{t})r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}\right]=u_{t}\,\mathbb{E}[r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}]+\mathbb{E}[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Pt0.A1.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\mid x_{t}].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.11" class="ltx_p">Using <a href="#Pt0.A1.E32" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">32</span></a> in <a href="#Pt0.A1.E31" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a> gives</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I+\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})=\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I+\frac{\alpha_{t}}{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.12" class="ltx_p">Rearranging,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E34" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\frac{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\left(J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\frac{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\left(J_{x_{t}}u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}I\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.13" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r_{t}\|^{2}=\mathrm{tr}(r_{t}r_{t}^{\top})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r_{t}\|^{2}=\mathrm{tr}(r_{t}r_{t}^{\top})</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E35" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\operatorname{tr}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.337em">⁡</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\operatorname{tr}\,\mathbb{E}\!\left[r_{t}r_{t}^{\top}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.14" class="ltx_p">Taking <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{tr}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{tr}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> on both sides of <a href="#Pt0.A1.E34" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a> and using
<math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{tr}(I)=d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{tr}(I)=d</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{tr}(J_{x_{t}}u_{t})=\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{tr}(J_{x_{t}}u_{t})=\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.E36" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\frac{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\left(\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}d\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]=\frac{\beta_{t}^{2}b_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\left(\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}d\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.15" class="ltx_p">Finally, substituting <a href="#Pt0.A1.E23" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a> into <a href="#Pt0.A1.E36" title="In proof. ‣ 0.A.3 Main Proof ‣ Appendix 0.A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">36</span></a> yields</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Pt0.A1.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.500em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\!\left[\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\|^{2}\ \middle|\ x_{t}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.E37.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\beta_{t}(\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t})}{\alpha_{t}}\left(\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}d\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\beta_{t}(\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t})}{\alpha_{t}}\left(\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\frac{\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\beta_{t}}d\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Pt0.A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Pt0.A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}\,d\Big)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}\,d\Big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p2.16" class="ltx_p">Therefore,</p>
<table id="Pt0.A1.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Pt0.A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}^{*}_{\text{CFM}}(x_{t},t)=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\right\|^{2}\;\middle|\;x_{t}\right]=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}d\Big).\qed" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>CFM</mtext><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>β</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">.</mo><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" lspace="0.0835em" mathvariant="italic" separator="true">∎</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}^{*}_{\text{CFM}}(x_{t},t)=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|u_{t}(x_{t})-v_{t}\right\|^{2}\;\middle|\;x_{t}\right]=\frac{\dot{\alpha}_{t}\beta_{t}-\alpha_{t}\dot{\beta}_{t}}{\alpha_{t}}\Big(\beta_{t}\nabla_{x_{t}}\cdot u_{t}(x_{t})-\dot{\beta}_{t}d\Big).\qed</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.B </span>Algorithm</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide the detailed algorithm of FDS framework in Sec. <a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2 Flow Divergence Sampler ‣ 3 Method ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a> of the main paper.
The pseudo-code for <span id="Pt0.A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Refine<math id="Pt0.A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, introduced in <a href="#S3.E11" title="In 3.2 Flow Divergence Sampler ‣ 3 Method ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, and for the overall FDS framework is provided below.
Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix 0.B Algorithm ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> details the refinement procedure of FDS, while Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Appendix 0.B Algorithm ‣ Training-Free Refinement of Flow Matching with Divergence-based Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> presents the overall generation pipeline.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> <span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Refine<math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{t},t;u_{\theta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{t},t;u_{\theta})</annotation></semantics></math></span></figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> number of candidates <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>, number of iteration <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, perturbation scale <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, flow model <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{x}_{t}^{0}\leftarrow x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{x}_{t}^{0}\leftarrow x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1,2,\ldots,N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1,2,\ldots,N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t,0}^{n}\leftarrow\tilde{x}_{t}^{\,n-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t,0}^{n}\leftarrow\tilde{x}_{t}^{\,n-1}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=1,2,\ldots,M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=1,2,\ldots,M</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{t,m}^{n}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{t,m}^{n}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t,m}^{n}\leftarrow\tilde{x}_{t}^{\,n-1}+\sigma_{t}\xi_{t,m}^{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t,m}^{n}\leftarrow\tilde{x}_{t}^{\,n-1}+\sigma_{t}\xi_{t,m}^{n}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}\leftarrow\arg\min_{m\in\{0,1,\ldots,M\}}\hat{\delta}_{t}\!\left(x_{t,m}^{n};u_{\theta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}\leftarrow\arg\min_{m\in\{0,1,\ldots,M\}}\hat{\delta}_{t}\!\left(x_{t,m}^{n};u_{\theta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\delta}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>δ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\delta}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> approximates the divergence.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{x}_{t}^{n}\leftarrow x_{t,m_{t}}^{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{x}_{t}^{n}\leftarrow x_{t,m_{t}}^{n}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{x}_{t}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mi>N</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{x}_{t}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
